DESCRIPTION:What is Eid without challenges and participation? And how can its joy be complete if we do not gather\, laugh\, and compete together? At the Children&rsquo\;s Museum Amphitheater\, an exciting atmosphere inspired by the spirit of Eid comes to life. You will take part in fun questions\, quick challenges\, and visual and sound-based games full of surprises. We cheer\, collaborate\, and support our teams&hellip\; because Eid is complete through participation\, and joy grows through friendly competition.
